<body><h1>LH-04 Apple Pie — 15% EDT — 30 mL</h1>
<p><strong>Variant ID:</strong> LH-04<br />
<strong>Formula:</strong> <code>ysl20:LH-04:v2</code><br />
<strong>Concentration:</strong> 15% v/v<br />
<strong>Perfume concentrate:</strong> 4,500 µL<br />
<strong>EtOH:</strong> 25,500 µL<br />
<strong>Finished:</strong> 30,000 µL / 30 mL  </p>
<p><strong>Mix legend — pour G1 → G6:</strong> G1 Resins/powders/viscous stocks · G2 Woods/amber · G3 Musks · G4 Floral body/fruit · G5 Citrus/green/aromatics · G6 Trace/high-impact</p>
