<h2>Pour sequence</h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>G1:</strong> Tonkarome (20%) 248 · Isobutavan 40</li>
<li><strong>G2:</strong> Iso E Super 600 · Cedarwood Virginia 500 · Vertofix 300 · Sandalore 240 · Indian Vetiver EO 180 · Amberwood F 20</li>
<li><strong>G3:</strong> Ethylene Brassylate 350</li>
<li><strong>G4:</strong> Hedione 420 · Alpha Isomethyl Ionone 300 · Linalyl Acetate 196 · Florol 50</li>
<li><strong>G5:</strong> Bergamot FCF 340 · Linalool 162 · Lemon FCF 110 · Dihydromyrcenol 104 · Ginger EO 100</li>
<li><strong>G6:</strong> Hexyl Acetate (10%) 100 · Allyl Cyclohexyl Propionate (10%) 70 · Vanillin (10%) 20 · Ethyl 2-Methylbutyrate (0.1%) 20 · 2-Acetyl Pyrazine (1%) 10 · Cinnamaldehyde (1%) 10 · Black Pepper EO 10</li>
</ul>
<p>Stir after each group; rest 48 h before wear-testing.</p></body></html>